Package: twcovid
Title: Fetch and Aggregate Taiwan COVID-19 Open Data
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Yuyou", "Liou", email = "yuyou.liou@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Download Taiwan CDC severe special infectious pneumonia (COVID-19)
    confirmed-case open data from the government open data platform
    (data.gov.tw / od.cdc.gov.tw) and reshape it into analysis-ready tables.
    Cases can be tallied by day, week, or month; by onset date (發病日) or case
    judgment date (個案研判日); and optionally zero-filled into a fully balanced
    panel over any combination of region, township, sex, imported status, and
    age group.
